Build 050 (diagnostic only): for each depth-compare texture a draw binds, log once per distinct combination
the raw guest sampler (compare enable/function, wrap, filters, border) and the bound view (EDEN_DEPTH_SAMPLER),
and dump the stage's used constant buffers once per program to /data/eden-nx2/logs/depth-cbuf-*.bin
(EDEN_DEPTH_CBUF). For the static shadow map that the screen shadow mask reads as lit. Rendering unchanged.

